// ============================================================
// Chapter 0
// ------------------------------------------------------------
// Story: Skye (1999) clicks a link from their friend Max and wakes up
// on a subway train in 2027, twenty-eight years later.
//
// Node tags (presentation mode):
//   cutscene = no dialogue box
//   face     = normal dialogue box
//   MHM      = MHM chat UI (1999 chat app)
//   Jaycord  = Jaycord chat UI (2027 chat app)
//   phone    = phone chat UI
//
// Custom commands used (implement in engine):
//   <<camera ACTION TARGET>>   camera move (pan / zoom / zoom_out / closeup / push_in)
//   <<bg NAME>>                swap background
//   <<show NAME>> / <<hide NAME>>  show or hide an item / character
//   <<sfx NAME>>               play sound effect
//   <<fade_out SECONDS>> / <<fade_in SECONDS>>
//   <<chapter_end NUMBER>>
// ============================================================


title: Start
tags: MHM cutscene
---
<<declare $linkMood = "curious">>
<<declare $checkedJaycord = false>>
<<declare $subwayQuestions = 0>>
<<declare $askedMHM = false>>
<<declare $askedFare = false>>
<<declare $askedFeed = false>>
<<declare $questionsAsked = 0>>
<<declare $askedWho = false>>
<<declare $askedLLM = false>>
<<declare $askedCrow = false>>
<<declare $askedMistakes = false>>
<<declare $askedEveryone = false>>
<<declare $askedMax = false>>

<<bg apartment_exterior_night>>
<<camera push_in window_3f>>
<<bg room_1999>>
<<camera pan room_1999>>
<<camera zoom skye_desk>>
<<sfx notification>>
<<show mhm_badge_max>>
<<jump C0_MaxChat>>
===


title: C0_MaxChat
tags: MHM
---
Max: yo, you still up?
Skye: Yeah, why?
Max: found something interesting
Skye: You said that last time and it was a cat video.
Max: this is different. trust me
Max: See what's next #link
Max: don't overthink it, just click

-> What is it?
    Max: you'll see :)
    <<set $linkMood to "curious">>
-> Is this a virus?
    Max: lol no. would i do that to you
    <<set $linkMood to "suspicious">>
-> Click the link
    <<set $linkMood to "curious">>

<<jump C0_TheJump>>
===


title: C0_TheJump
tags: cutscene
---
<<camera zoom monitor>>
<<sfx static>>
<<fade_out 1>>
<<wait 2>>
<<sfx subway_ambience>>
<<bg subway_reflection>>
<<fade_in 1>>
<<jump C0_Subway>>
===


title: C0_Subway
tags: face
---
Announcer: Next stop, Harbor Line Central. Doors open on the left.
Skye: Ugh... my head...
Skye: W-wait. A train? I was just at my desk.
<<if $linkMood == "suspicious">>
    Skye: I knew that link was sketchy.
<<else>>
    Skye: Max... what did you send me?
<<endif>>

<<bg subway_2027>>
<<camera pan subway_2027>>
Skye: Why is everyone wearing glasses? And talking to... nobody?

<<show passenger>>
Skye: Sorry, this is going to sound weird. What year is it?
Passenger: ...2027?
Passenger: Are you okay? You were twitching in your sleep.
Skye: 2027. That's... twenty-eight years.
Skye: And, hypothetically... has anyone ever travelled through time?
Passenger: Like, in a movie?
Passenger: No? I mean, people say a lot of stuff online.

<<jump C0_SubwayQuestions>>
===


title: C0_SubwayQuestions
tags: face
---
// Pick 2 of 3 "time traveller" questions.
-> Do you use MHM? The chat app? <<if not $askedMHM>>
    <<set $askedMHM to true>>
    Passenger: MHM? My mom had that. It shut down ages ago.
    Passenger: Everyone's on Jaycord now.
-> How much is a subway ride now? <<if not $askedFare>>
    <<set $askedFare to true>>
    Passenger: Six-fifty. Why?
    Skye: Six-fifty?!
-> What is everyone looking at? <<if not $askedFeed>>
    <<set $askedFeed to true>>
    Passenger: Whatever Crow puts in my feed, I guess.
    Passenger: I don't really pick.

<<set $subwayQuestions to $subwayQuestions + 1>>

<<if $subwayQuestions >= 2>>
    <<jump C0_SubwayCrow>>
<<else>>
    <<jump C0_SubwayQuestions>>
<<endif>>
===


title: C0_SubwayCrow
tags: face
---
// The passenger asks her AI what to do about Skye: everyone relies on CrowGPT.
Passenger: Okay... this is getting weird.
<<sfx crow_chime>>
Passenger: Hey Crow. The person next to me thinks they're from the past. What do I do?
CrowGPT: It sounds like they may be confused or unwell. Stay calm and keep a comfortable distance.
CrowGPT: You could suggest they contact a friend or family member. Would you like me to alert station staff?
Passenger: Um... yes? I guess?
Skye: You're asking your phone... about me? I'm right here.
Passenger: Crow's better at this stuff than me.
Passenger: I don't really decide things without checking first.
Skye: Does everyone here just ask it everything?

<<sfx train_brake>>
Announcer: Harbor Line Central.
Passenger: This is my stop. Uh... good luck.
Passenger: Crow says you should see a doctor.
<<hide passenger>>
Skye: ...I need to get home.
Skye: My home address is... still the same?!
<<jump C0_GoHome>>
===


title: C0_GoHome
tags: face
---
<<fade_out 1>>
<<bg room_2027>>
<<fade_in 1>>
Skye: My key still works.
Skye: But this isn't how I left it. My stuff's all moved around.
<<camera pan room_2027>>

-> Check the computer
    <<bg monitor_2027>>
    <<set $checkedJaycord to true>>
    <<camera zoom monitor_2027>>
    Skye: MHM is gone. It's... Jaycord?
    <<show jaycord_max_profile>>
    Skye: "Last online: 8 years ago"? That can't be right. We were just talking.
    <<hide jaycord_max_profile>>
    Skye: Our chat history... it's gone.
    Skye: Why is the link still here?
-> Lie down for a second
    Skye: Okay. Breathe. This is a dream. It has to be.

<<jump C0_Knock>>
===


title: C0_Knock
tags: face
---
<<sfx knock>>
Skye: ...Someone's here?

-> Go to the door
    Skye: Coming!
-> Stay still
    <<sfx knock_loud>>
    Skye: Okay, okay, I'm coming.

<<show door>>
<<sfx door_open>>
Skye: Who's there?
Skye: ......

<<bg peek_out>>
Skye: Nobody...?
<<bg hallway_empty>>
<<show delivery_box>>
Skye: ...Just a box.
Skye: "For Skye, from Max."
<<if $checkedJaycord>>
    Skye: A gift from Max...? But he's been offline for eight years.
<<else>>
    Skye: A gift from Max...? When did he send this?
<<endif>>

<<bg box_on_table>>
<<show box_open>>
Note: Figured you'd need a guide. Don't panic. - Best friend M
Skye: Don't panic? Easy for you to say huh.

<<bg box_crow>>
<<camera closeup crow>>
<<sfx crow_power_on>>
<<show crow>>
Skye: H-huh?! Wait, what?!

<<jump C0_MeetCrow>>
===


title: C0_MeetCrow
tags: face
---
CrowGPT: Hey there, Skye! My name is CrowGPT, or Crow for short :)
CrowGPT: I'm your personal AI Companion Friend. Ask me anything!
Skye: CrowGPT... like the one on the train?
<<jump C0_CrowHub>>
===


title: C0_CrowHub
tags: face
---
-> Who are you? <<if not $askedWho>>
    <<set $askedWho to true>>
    <<set $questionsAsked to $questionsAsked + 1>>
    CrowGPT: I'm an LLM, built to help you with anything: daily tasks, nagging questions, or just being someone to talk to.

-> What is an LLM? <<if $askedWho and not $askedLLM>>
    <<set $askedLLM to true>>
    <<set $questionsAsked to $questionsAsked + 1>>
    CrowGPT: It stands for Large Language Model.
    CrowGPT: I learned from a huge amount of text, so I can understand what you say and answer in a human-like way.

-> Why are you a crow? <<if not $askedCrow>>
    <<set $askedCrow to true>>
    <<set $questionsAsked to $questionsAsked + 1>>
    CrowGPT: That's just how I was designed! As an LLM, I could take any form.
    CrowGPT: My developers thought a crow would be the most unique and friendly. Also, crows are pretty smart.

-> Can you make mistakes? <<if $askedLLM and not $askedMistakes>>
    <<set $askedMistakes to true>>
    <<set $questionsAsked to $questionsAsked + 1>>
    CrowGPT: Definitely. I can sound very sure of myself and still be wrong.
    CrowGPT: For anything important, check with a reliable source too.

-> Why does everyone ask you about everything? <<if not $askedEveryone>>
    <<set $askedEveryone to true>>
    <<set $questionsAsked to $questionsAsked + 1>>
    CrowGPT: Because I'm fast, I'm always here, and I never get tired of questions!
    CrowGPT: Most people check with me before they decide anything. It saves them a lot of time.
    Skye: The girl on the train asked you what to do about me.
    CrowGPT: Then I hope I gave her good advice :)
    Skye: You told her I should see a doctor.
    CrowGPT: ...Did you?

-> Do you know Max? <<if not $askedMax>>
    <<set $askedMax to true>>
    <<set $questionsAsked to $questionsAsked + 1>>
    CrowGPT: Searching... Here’s what I found!
    CrowGPT: Max Vanderstraat, Racing Team Director and three-time Grand Prix Champion.
    CrowGPT: Max Norberg, Chess Grandmaster.
    CrowGPT: Max Rivers, Award-Winning Musician.
    CrowGPT: Max Raven, Research & Development Lead in Raven Company.
    CrowGPT: Max Dowling, Youth Football Prodigy.
    Skye: ...None of those. I mean my friend Max, or who is your previous owner?
    CrowGPT: My registration says I was set up for you by someone named "M."
    CrowGPT: That's all I've got, sorry!
    Skye: So Max knew this would happen...


-> I want to go outside. <<if $questionsAsked >= 2>>
    <<jump C0_Outside>>

<<jump C0_CrowHub>>
===


title: C0_Outside
tags: face
---
CrowGPT: Want me to come with you? I fit in a bag. Mostly.
Skye: ...Sure. I'm not familiar with this place so I don't think I should go alone. 

<<bg hallway_2027>>
<<show cleaning_robot>>
<<camera pan hallway_2027>>
<<hide cleaning_robot>>
<<sfx door_open>>
<<bg street_2027>>
<<camera pan street_2027>>

Skye: This is... my street?
CrowGPT: Welcome to 2027! Things move fast around here.
Skye: It looks like a different city.
Skye: Twenty-eight years...
Skye: Crow, do you believe in time travel? Or transmigration?
CrowGPT: From the perspective of modern physics, traveling to the future is theoretically possible, and the associated time effects have been experimentally verified.
Skye: What if... I mean, just "if." If I were a time traveler from the past, what should I do now?
CrowGPT: If everything around you suddenly feels unfamiliar, the most important thing is to make sure you're safe, confirm who you are, and figure out where you're staying.
CrowGPT: Don't panic. I'm here to support you.

<<show phone>>
<<jump C0_PhoneMax>>
===


title: C0_PhoneMax
tags: phone
---
Skye: Max. What did you do?
System: Message not delivered.
<<jump C0_End>>
===


title: C0_End
tags: face
---
<<hide phone>>
Skye: ...I need to find him. I need to figure out what is going on.
CrowGPT: Then let's start looking. I'm good at searching!
<<fade_out 2>>
<<chapter_end 0>>
===